  "texts": {
    "preamble": "T.S.S.Traders A Registered ... vs The District Collector on 31 August, 2017 Bench: K.K.Sasidharan, G.R.Swaminathan Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 31.08.2017 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice K.K.Sasidharan and The Honourable Mr.Justice G.R.Swaminathan W.P.(MD)No.2399 of 2013 and M.P.(MD).No.1 of 2013",
    "facts": "The petitioner filed this Writ Petition to direct the respondents to remove the seal affixed on the business premises bearing No.2240, 92 Cross Street, TNHB, Villapuram, Madurai, which was sealed on 05.02.2013, alleging violation of the provisions of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act. 2.The learned Special Government Pleader, on instruction from the respondents, submitted that the respondents had already taken sample in 2013 itself and it was sent for analysis. According to the respondents, there is no need for keeping the sealed premises any more on account of the test conducted by taking sample.",
